            <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a name="_Hlk519867607"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">FFII(P) (1755)</span></a></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">This classification is eligible for the following pay:</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">$4255 - $5515 Base Salary (paid every month) </span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">$2238 - $2988 Extended Duty Week Compensation (paid every 4 weeks)</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; text-decoration: underline;">$250 - $6000 Paramedic Bonus (paid every November; amount based on months worked)</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">$83,154 – $111,024 Annual Compensation</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial;">In addition to the above pay items, employees are eligible for medical benefits (health, dental, vision) and may be eligible for other pay differentials.<br /><br /></span></span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917;"><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Benefit information can be found on the&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protecti